## 2. Original Game Assets, Audio, Art & Intellectual Property
All original 3D models, textures, voice recordings, animations, sound effects,
characters, and narrative elements from the original release of **"Asunder: Earthbound" (2013)**
remain the exclusive intellectual property and copyright of **Aldin Dynamics ehf.**.

This repository is an unofficial, non-commercial, non-profit community digital preservation effort
dedicated to historical archiving and VR hardware compatibility (restoring accessibility on modern 64-bit systems and OpenXR hardware following the deprecation of the Oculus Rift DK1 runtime).

- **Non-Commercial**: No parts of the original assets may be used for commercial purposes.
- **Attribution**: Original game design, characters, art, and concept by **Aldin Dynamics**.
- **Takedown Policy**: If you are a copyright holder or representative of Aldin Dynamics and wish to have these assets removed or modified, please open an issue or contact the repository maintainers.
